    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002990/extras/01dc08b3a1cbe6281dac033befb68b63.avif?t=1749722400\" data-has-big /></div>In Super Skeleton Butler, you play as a skeleton defending your dungeon home from adventurers trying to steal your treasure. Build traps, cast spells and slay hundreds of enemies while protecting your precious treasure from dirty, thieving humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002990/extras/39a6864f58afbc070b00571fe412f2d7.poster.avif?t=1749722400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002990/extras/39a6864f58afbc070b00571fe412f2d7.webm?t=1749722400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Meet (and fight) a bunch of colorful and dangerous adventurers, each with unique powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Use a variety of traps and spells to kill them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Visit different areas of your skeleton home like the dungeon, dwarven caves and ancient ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-You get to be a skeleton </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002990/extras/01dc08b3a1cbe6281dac033befb68b63.avif?t=1749722400\" data-has-big /></div>In Super Skeleton Butler, you play as a skeleton defending your dungeon home from adventurers trying to steal your treasure. Build traps, cast spells and slay hundreds of enemies while protecting your precious treasure from dirty, thieving humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002990/extras/39a6864f58afbc070b00571fe412f2d7.poster.avif?t=1749722400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002990/extras/39a6864f58afbc070b00571fe412f2d7.webm?t=1749722400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Meet (and fight) a bunch of colorful and dangerous adventurers, each with unique powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Use a variety of traps and spells to kill them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Visit different areas of your skeleton home like the dungeon, dwarven caves and ancient ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-You get to be a skeleton </p>",
    "short_description": "Protect your treasure from hordes of do-gooder adventurers! As a skeleton butler, it\u2019s your duty to keep out the riff-raff using a variety of traps, spells and good old skeleton magic in this tower defense/platformer mashup.",
